flowchart TB
 I[Interface drawings and datums] --> C[Parametric mount CAD]
 M[Material and attachment properties] --> S[Static thermal modal model]
 C --> S
 S --> U[Optical interface motion]
 G[Grating and slit geometry] --> J[Wavelength sensitivity Jacobian]
 U --> J
 T[Correlated tolerance inputs] --> B[Spectral error budget]
 J --> B
 L[Calibration line measurements] --> V[Repeatability verification]
 B --> V
 V --> P[Controlled build and evidence matrix]
